            "text": "<p>Built for every role involved in planning and delivering projects, our robust but extremely easy-to-use project management suite of tools was built to meet the needs of both strategic decision-makers and delivery teams across the built environment.</p><p>Asta supports clients, executives, commercial teams, estimators, planners and schedulers, planning leads, project managers, site managers, field engineers, IT teams, and subcontractors. </p><p>The Asta suite delivers real-time project planning and management, construction scheduling, and programme visibility across all stages of delivery. With cloud-based access, role-specific controls, and a single source of truth, teams can improve coordination, reduce risk, and keep projects on time and within budget.</p>"
